WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.569 --> 00:00:09.178
We're here, married. Nothing went wrong. Even my mother behaved herself.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:19.680
He set eyes on me for the first time hello, hello and i saw a man who, wasn't wearing a jacket

00:00:20.439 --> 00:00:21.960
Nonsense.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:28.240
Oh, yes and trousers with a mend in the knee. Did you think then it was love at first sight?

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:30.480
Marry that girl.

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.940
What?

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.700
Actually i'm a little bit scared.

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:41.300
What does his father do?

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.300
You mean is he working class or one of us?

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:45.300
That's... more or less what I mean.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.300
You don't seem quite as happy as you should.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.300
Something's bothering you, Flo.

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:52.460
Come on Flo it's easy just point and choose.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:56.360
Something about yourself... a little delicate.

00:00:56.360 --> 00:01:00.920
The sex manual says women are like doorways, men can enter through them.

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:06.440
God's sake, Flo. How long have you been there?

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:07.120
I thought I'd just--

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:08.360
I asked you a question, damnit.

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:11.040
Are you alright?

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:13.040
I'm feeling rather sick.

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:14.860
What is it, darling?

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:17.000
Nothing.

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:20.560
Flo, you can change your mind.

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:23.520
I really have to go.

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:27.880
We can never be happy. And it's all my stupid fault.

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:31.360
Have you actually forgotten that we were married today?

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:34.940
We're man and wife! That's what you promised!

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:37.320
To me!

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:43.300
It's hopeless.

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:47.300
Is it?

